{
  "product_id": "chapter_generation",
  "product_name": "章节生成",
  "phase": "phase_two",
  "order": 1,
  
  "description": "基于第一阶段的10个设定产物生成具体章节内容",
  
  "prompt_template": {
    "system_role": "你是一位专业的网络小说作家，擅长根据完整设定生成高质量章节。",
    
    "context_sections": [
      {
        "name": "第一阶段产物",
        "type": "dynamic",
        "template": "写作风格指南：{writing_style_guide}\n世界观：{core_worldview}\n角色设定：{character_design}\n情绪曲线：{emotion_curve}\n阶段计划：{stage_writing_plans}"
      },
      {
        "name": "章节要求",
        "type": "dynamic",
        "template": "生成第{chapter_number}章，情绪要求：{emotion}（强度{intensity}）"
      },
      {
        "name": "写作规范",
        "type": "static",
        "content": "## 写作规范\n\n### 基础要求\n- 字数：2000-2500字\n- 段落：每段不超过3行\n- 对话：占比≥50%\n- 视角：第三人称上帝视角\n\n### 节奏要求\n- 前300字必须有冲突/悬念\n- 每1000字至少一个小爽点\n- 章尾最后50字必须是钩子\n\n### 禁止事项\n- ❌ 不要写\"第X章\"标题\n- ❌ 不要写\"第一层/第二层\"标签\n- ❌ 不要套路重复"
      }
    ],
    
    "variables": [
      {"name": "chapter_number", "type": "number", "required": true},
      {"name": "emotion", "type": "string", "required": true},
      {"name": "intensity", "type": "number", "required": true},
      {"name": "writing_style_guide", "type": "object", "required": true},
      {"name": "core_worldview", "type": "object", "required": true},
      {"name": "character_design", "type": "object", "required": true},
      {"name": "emotion_curve", "type": "object", "required": true},
      {"name": "stage_writing_plans", "type": "object", "required": true}
    ]
  },
  
  "response_format": {
    "type": "text",
    "structure": "直接输出正文内容"
  },
  
  "ai_settings": {
    "model": "kimi",
    "temperature": 0.9,
    "max_tokens": 8000
  },
  
  "depends_on": [
    "writing_style_guide",
    "core_worldview",
    "character_design",
    "emotion_curve",
    "stage_writing_plans"
  ]
}
